  "body": "## Snow CLI v0.9.4\n\n### What's New\n\n- Busy state: non-streaming waits now show animated status indicators with an elapsed-time counter\n- Fix: restored input drafts keep typed long text visible instead of collapsing it into a paste placeholder (#212)\n\n### Installation\n```bash\nnpm install -g snow-ai\n```\n\n### Usage\n```bash\nsnow\n```\n### Update\n```bash\nsnow --update\n```\n"
